{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/947704-can-the-light-weapons-fighting-style-work-with-shiv-brass-knuckles","id":947704,"title":"Can the Light Weapons Fighting Style work with Shiv / Brass Knuckles?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-10T05:57:04-07:00","id":947704,"title":"Can the Light Weapons Fighting Style work with Shiv / Brass Knuckles?","content":"Just curious. Light weapon just says you need to be using a weapon with a modifier of 2 or less. Shiv andbbrass knuckles count. In the case of shiv, you can even use a classically appropriate weapon like a knife or a rapier.<br /> <br /> This would let you use the Light Weapon FS with the brawl skill, or even comhine that FS with certain aspects of Martial Arts or Streetfighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T09:42:40-07:00","id":947826,"title":"","content":"No, it doesn't let you use Light Weapons with the Brawl Skill. So yes, you could use it with a small &quot;s&quot; shiv, since that's valid with both Skills with the Shiv Merit, but not brass knuckles since that isn't valid with the Weaponry Skill. However, Weaponry Fighting Styles don't combine with the Brawl Skill or Fighting styles unless you have something that explicitly says they can.<br /> <br /> Basically, just because the Shiv Merit lets you use a shiv with Brawl or Weaponry does not mean the Shiv Merit allows you to interchange Brawl and Weaponry when using a shiv; you still have to pick which you're using at any given moment and which modifications come with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T13:10:17-07:00","id":947985,"title":"","content":"What you want is transfered manuever from Hurt locker, it allows you to buy an armed manuever as unarmed and vice versa, if it makes sense, so no say converting archery to unarmed for example. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}